{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:28 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:28 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:28 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"「一定掂」姚廄食尾胡\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/e8870d9aa0e5f3c8313a7fe700838167/2026-10/r9_4.jpg\"/><p>今晚第八場賽事跑完後，方嘉柏、廖康銘、羅富全及沈集成均有機會爭奪練馬師王冠軍，需要在尾場分勝負，結果卻是由姚本輝馬房的「一定掂」力壓「同心同樂」險勝，姚本輝今晚起孖，奧爾民則連中三元，方嘉柏則以二十四分成為練馬師王冠軍。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T15:41:41.893792+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:28:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T22:37:56.853129+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T15:37:44.178663+00:00","content_hash":"0f520688036079903f0bbb53d03a8761bfc9c111d0b0af7d916d807ea5622499","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}